---
import SiteLayout from '../../layouts/SiteLayout.astro';
import SDriveVisual from '../../components/SDriveVisual.astro';
import { getProjectById } from '../../data/portfolio';
const websiteUrl = getProjectById('sdrive')!.url;
import ProjectInvitation from '../../components/ProjectInvitation.astro';
---
<SiteLayout title="SDrive: Complete technical delivery"><section class="page-hero"><div class="container"><a class="text-link" href="/portfolio">← All work</a><p class="eyebrow" style="margin-top:32px">SDrive / Flagship case study</p><h1>Building and deploying<br/>a complete ride-hailing<br/>platform.</h1><p class="lead">I independently developed and delivered a complete ride-hailing solution: rider and driver Flutter apps, a marketing website, an administration portal, the backend, and deployment on Google Cloud.</p></div></section><section class="section"><div class="container split"><SDriveVisual /><div><span class="eyebrow">One connected delivery</span><h2>More than two apps.</h2><p>A ride-hailing service needs a customer experience, a driver experience, and tools for the team operating the business. Those pieces need to share a working backend and be ready for deployment.</p><p>My responsibility covered the connected platform, with the apps and operational systems delivered together.</p><div><span class="tag">Sole developer</span><span class="tag">Flutter apps</span><span class="tag">Web + administration</span><span class="tag">Backend + cloud</span></div><p class="muted" style="margin-top:24px;font-size:.85rem">Product screenshots and a walkthrough will be added here. The illustration shows the platform scope, rather than actual product screens.</p></div></div></section><section class="section dark"><div class="container"><span class="eyebrow">The connected solution</span><h2>Built for each side of the service.</h2><div class="grid"><article><h3>For riders</h3><p class="muted">A dedicated Flutter application for the customer’s ride-hailing experience.</p></article><article><h3>For drivers</h3><p class="muted">A separate Flutter application for the people delivering the service.</p></article><article><h3>For the business</h3><p class="muted">A marketing website and administration portal, connected to backend systems and cloud deployment.</p></article></div></div></section><section class="section"><div class="container split"><div><span class="eyebrow">My responsibility</span><h2>Ownership across<br/>the platform.</h2><p>I served as the sole developer across the rider and driver applications, web experiences, backend, and deployment. That allowed decisions to connect across the product instead of stopping at a single interface.</p></div><div class="card"><h3>Delivered scope</h3><ul class="list"><li>Rider Flutter app</li><li>Driver Flutter app</li><li>Marketing website</li><li>Administration portal</li><li>Backend systems</li><li>Google Cloud deployment</li></ul></div></div></section><section class="section outcome"><div class="container"><span class="eyebrow">Result</span><h2>A complete platform delivered.</h2><p class="lead">The outcome was a working ride-hailing solution built for the client and deployed on Google Cloud. The marketing website is available below. The rider and driver apps are coming soon; screenshots will be added as the case study is expanded.</p></div></section><section class="section sdrive-availability" aria-labelledby="availability-heading">
  <div class="container">
    <span class="eyebrow">Explore the product</span>
    <h2 id="availability-heading">SDrive availability</h2>
    <div class="grid">
      <article class="card">
        <h3>Marketing website</h3>
        <p>Explore SDrive online.</p>
        <a class="text-link" href={websiteUrl} target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Visit sdrive.africa ↗</a>
      </article>
      <article class="card">
        <h3>Rider app</h3>
        <p class="coming-soon">Coming soon</p>
      </article>
      <article class="card">
        <h3>Driver app</h3>
        <p class="coming-soon">Coming soon</p>
      </article>
    </div>
  </div>
</section><ProjectInvitation project="SDrive" /></SiteLayout><style>.outcome{background:#f7f0f0}.coming-soon{color:var(--color-navy);background:rgba(166,143,200,.15);border:1px solid rgba(166,143,200,.4);display:inline-block;padding:.4rem .8rem;border-radius:6px;font-size:.85rem}.sdrive-availability .card h3{margin-top:0}</style>
